 60TI2 L %B-=100                                                                
 60TI cL %B-$Only |b{+-} decay mode is expected.                                
 60TI cL T$From a fit to the implanted ion-|b{+-}-t spectrum using the          
 60TI2cL unbinned maximum-likelihood method. The data analysis                  
 60TI3cL included contributions from the parent, daughter and grand-daughter    
 60TI4cL decays, as well as a constant background. Uncertainty includes both    
 60TI5cL statistical and systematic components.                                 
                                                                                
